S('AU-01','Financial Services and Fintech','Understand how money products work, build a small digital money tool on paper and test it with practice data and clear consumer protections.',
 'Design and test a simple money tool (budget, payment reminder or savings tracker) with practice data and a fairness and privacy review.','About 140 hours over 3 to 6 months. Computer, free spreadsheet, practice data only, a licensed adviser for review, mentor and peer circle.',
 'Needs statement; flow design; practice-data test; fee and fairness table; privacy note; at least 70% on the check.',
 O4('Explain how payments, savings and credit work.','Build and test a simple tool with practice data.','Analyse cost, risk and fairness.','Create a clear customer guide.'),
 ['Financial services assistant','Customer support analyst','Fintech operations assistant','Product tester'],
 [M('How money moves','Understand',12,'Payer, bank, network, payee.','Payment steps and timing|Fees and who pays|Where errors occur','A transfer takes 1 day because of cut-off times.','Draw a payment path.','Steps labelled.','Why do transfers take time?','Cut-off times and checks.'),
  M('Savings, credit and interest','Understand',16,'Interest is the price of time.','Simple and compound interest|Cost of credit|Compare offers fairly','1000 at 5% for 2 years: simple 1100, compound 1102.50.','Calculate three cases.','Correct with currency.','Compound on 1000 at 5% for 2 years?','1102.50.'),
  M('Know the customer','Analyse',16,'Design for real needs.','Interview five users|List goals and fears|Pick one problem','Casual workers need a weekly budget.','Write a needs statement.','Evidence.','Why interview first?','Tools must fit real money habits.'),
  M('Design the tool','Create',20,'Simple flows, plain words.','Three screens or sheets|Show fees before action|Undo and help','Fee shown before confirm.','Build prototype.','Test passes.','Why show fees before action?','Fair consent.'),
  M('Test with practice data','Apply',24,'Never real money or accounts.','Create practice data|Run ten cases|Log faults','Rounding fault found.','Test.','Fault log.','Why practice data only?','Avoid harm and privacy breaches.'),
  M('Rules, privacy and fraud','Apply',20,'Money tools are regulated.','Check licensing needs with an adviser|Collect minimum data|Basic fraud checks','Two-step check for large transfers.','Write note.','Adviser comment.','Why involve an adviser?','Rules and licences vary and carry penalties.'),
  M('Fairness and cost','Evaluate',16,'Who gains and who pays?','Fee table|Effect on low-income users|Plain summary','Late fee cap protects users.','Build table.','Checked.','Name a fairness check.','Test effect on low-income users.'),
  M('Guide and review','Create',16,'Explain simply.','One-page guide|Three lessons|Next steps','Guide has examples.','Present.','Reviewed.','What goes in a customer guide?','Plain steps, fees and where to get help.')],
 safety="Learning only. Use practice data. Do not handle real accounts, lend, advise or move money unless licensed and permitted.")
S('AU-02','Pharma and Life Sciences Operations','Learn how medicines and health products move from development to patient, with a focus on quality records, safety and clear communication.',
 'Complete a quality-record exercise, a cold-chain exercise and a plain-language safety summary using practice documents.','About 140 hours over 3 to 6 months. Practice documents, free spreadsheet, a qualified adviser, mentor and peer circle.',
 'Quality records correct; cold-chain log reviewed; safety summary plain and accurate; ethics note; at least 70% on the check.',
 O4('Explain the path from development to patient.','Complete records and checks.','Analyse deviations.','Write a plain-language summary.'),
 ['Quality assistant','Documentation assistant','Supply chain assistant','Regulatory support assistant'],
 [M('Development to patient','Understand',12,'Many stages, each with checks.','Discovery, trials, approval, supply, monitoring|Why each stage exists|Who is responsible','A trial must be approved before starting.','Draw the path.','Stages named.','Why trials before supply?','To test safety and benefit.'),
  M('Quality records','Apply',20,'Clear, complete, dated.','Good documentation habits|Who, what, when|Correct errors visibly','Never overwrite; strike and initial.','Complete 10 practice records.','No gaps.','How correct a record?','Strike through, initial, date.'),
  M('Batch and traceability','Apply',16,'Know what went where.','Batch numbers|Chain of custody|Recall readiness','Trace one batch in 2 hours.','Trace exercise.','Timed.','Why batch numbers?','To trace and recall.'),
  M('Cold chain and storage','Apply',20,'Temperature protects products.','Range and logging|Excursions and actions|Calibrated sensors','8 C for 3 hours triggers review.','Review a log.','Decision recorded.','What is an excursion?','A reading outside the allowed range.'),
  M('Deviations and improvement','Analyse',20,'Find the cause.','Describe, cause, fix, prevent|Impact check|Trend','Missing signature cause: no checklist.','Analyse three.','Actions.','Four parts of a deviation report?','Describe, cause, fix, prevent.'),
  M('Safety communication','Create',20,'Say it plainly.','Plain summary of risks|Avoid claims|Use reading-level check','Write at grade 8.','Write summary.','Reviewed.','Why plain language?','Patients must understand risks.'),
  M('Ethics and consent','Evaluate',16,'Protect people.','Consent|Privacy|Honest reporting','Report adverse events.','Write note.','Reviewed.','Why report adverse events?','To protect patients.'),
  M('Review','Evaluate',16,'Learn.','Three lessons|Plan|Share','Add checklist.','Present.','Plan.','What next?','Improve records and checks.')],
 safety="Learning only. Use practice documents. Never handle, advise on or supply medicines unless qualified and permitted.")
S('AU-03','Data Analysis and Data Science Practice','Ask a clear question, clean data, find patterns, test claims and present results honestly.',
 'Answer one real question with a public or practice dataset and present a clear, honest report with limits stated.','About 150 hours over 3 to 6 months. Computer, free spreadsheet and notebook tools, practice data, mentor and peer circle.',
 'Question; clean data log; analysis with checks; chart; honest limits; at least 70% on the check.',
 O4('Explain question, data and decision.','Clean and analyse a dataset.','Test whether a pattern is real.','Create a clear chart and report.'),
 ['Data analyst assistant','Reporting analyst','Junior data scientist','Research assistant'],
 [M('Ask a good question','Understand',12,'A clear question saves hours.','Who decides what with it|Measurable terms|Time and place','Do weekday sales fall after promotions?','Write 3 questions.','Best one chosen.','Name a good question trait.','Measurable and tied to a decision.'),
  M('Get and understand data','Apply',16,'Know your columns.','Source and date|Units|Missing values','Missing values coded as 999.','Describe dataset.','Dictionary.','Why check units?','Mixed units give wrong answers.'),
  M('Clean data','Apply',24,'Record every change.','Duplicates, errors, missing|Keep raw copy|Change log','Removed 12 duplicates.','Clean.','Log.','Why keep a raw copy?','To undo and check changes.'),
  M('Describe','Analyse',20,'Mean, median, spread.','Use median for skewed data|Group and compare|Percentages need counts','Mean 52 but median 31.','Compute.','Correct.','When prefer the median?','When data is skewed.'),
  M('Visualise','Create',20,'Chart that answers.','Right chart type|Clear labels and units|Start axes honestly','Bar for categories, line for time.','Make two charts.','Peer reads in 10 s.','Why label units?','Readers need to interpret.'),
  M('Test claims','Analyse',24,'Pattern or chance?','Sample size|Compare groups fairly|Correlation is not cause','Ice cream and sunburn rise together.','Test one claim.','Note.','Correlation equals cause?','No.'),
  M('Ethics and privacy','Evaluate',16,'Data about people needs care.','Remove identifiers|Bias check|Consent','Check group bias.','Write note.','Reviewed.','Name one bias check.','Compare results across groups.'),
  M('Report','Create',18,'Answer first.','Answer, evidence, limits, next step|One page|Reproducible steps','Lead with the finding.','Present.','Reviewed.','Report order?','Answer, evidence, limits, next step.')],
 safety="Learning only. Use public or practice data; never publish personal data.")
